# ION Orchard Loyalty Pipeline

## First Time Setup

### Step 1 — Download the code

Click the green **Code** button → **Download ZIP** → unzip anywhere

OR if you have Git:
git clone https://github.com/yourname/ion-pipeline.git

### Step 2 — Install Python (if you don't have it)

Download from: https://www.python.org/downloads/

- Windows: check **"Add Python to PATH"** during install
- Mac: use the macOS installer package

### Step 3 — Run setup (once only)

**Windows:** Double-click `setup_windows.bat`

**Mac:** Right-click `setup_mac.command` → Open → Open
(Right-click bypasses the Mac security warning)

Wait 3-5 minutes for packages to install.

### Step 4 — Configure your paths

Open `config_ION.xlsx` and fill in:

| Setting | What to put |
|---|---|
| raw_data | Folder containing your Excel source files |
| cleaned_data | An empty folder for pipeline outputs |
| combined_data | An empty folder for analysis outputs |

### Step 5 — Launch

**Windows:** Double-click `RUN_APP.bat`

**Mac:** Double-click `RUN_APP.command`

Browser opens automatically at http://localhost:8501

---

## Every Time After Setup

Just double-click `RUN_APP.bat` (Windows) or `RUN_APP.command` (Mac).